Mirror provenance
Registry sync records exact Mainnet source UUID → Testnet project UUID mapping.
A project code mapped to a different Mainnet UUID is rejected.
Mainnet project suspension/removal invalidates the Testnet provenance eligibility.
Public project registry never exposes provenance, proof tickets, Owner UUIDs or application data.
Testnet schema tables have RLS and no anon / authenticated direct data permissions.
